 "remarks": "HIGHEST & BEST DUE MONDAY 10/19 AT 5 PM! This is a Home Full of History, A Property Full of Possibilities! One home. Two units. So many possibilities! Offered as an estate sale, this two-family property presents a wonderful opportunity for homeowners and investors alike.  The first-floor unit welcomes you with beautiful hardwood floors, a spacious living room, dining room, eat-in kitchen, bedroom, and full bathroom. New wall-mounted A/C units with remotes add comfort and convenience. Need a little extra room? This unit also offers access to a partially finished lower level featuring additional usable space, a full bathroom, and kitchenette!  Head upstairs to the second-floor unit, where you'll find two bedrooms, a full bathroom, an eat-in kitchen, a comfortable living room, washer/dryer hookup, and LVP flooring throughout. There is also access to a full attic.  Here's a bonus you'll love - both units enjoy their own private decks! Perfect for morning coffee, relaxing after a long day, or enjoying a little fresh air.  Additional highlights include a 2019 roof, 2017 hot water heater, newly paved driveway, natural gas heat and solar panels that are fully transferable with zero transfer fees, offering the potential for savings on utility costs.  Whether you're looking to live in one unit and rent the other, expand your investment portfolio, or create a new chapter, 29 Madison Place is packed with potential!",
